# Generated 2026-09-24 (Hermes fill-in, patch 84)
#
# Companion to the libcss half (same patch number): the three
# background-size readers in redraw.c only understood the codes
# 0 (auto), >0 (px), -1 (cover), -2 (contain), so the percent codes
# the parser now emits (<= -3) would have drawn at the image's
# natural size. Each reader resolves wc/hc <= -3 as a percentage of
# the positioning area (a percent on one axis only keeps the image's
# aspect on the other), per CSS 2.1/Backgrounds spec.
# See docs/phase-0/11-real-sites.md.
